units si
atom_style sphere
boundary f f f
newton off
read_data particles.data
comm_modify vel yes
pair_style lubricate/poly .001 0 0 2.150001e-6 2.5e-6 1 0
pair_coeff * *
neighbor 1e-7 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check no
thermo_style custom step atoms
run 0
write_dump all custom forces.dump id radius x y z vx vy vz fx fy fz modify sort id format float %.17g
